tacting: Jason Poposki | Technical Manager (Bathurst, Dubbo and Orange) | jpoposki@csu.edu.au | Ph: (02) 6338 4817 Closing Date: 11pm, 25 October 2026 Advertised: 30 Sep 2026 09:00 AM - AUS Eastern Standard Time Applications close: 25 Oct 2026 11:00 PM - AUS Eastern Daylight Time Apply now Refer a friend Back to search results"
